Description: Firmware for miscellaneous Qualcomm devices
 This package provides firmware used by Linux kernel drivers
 qaic, qcom-geni-se, qcom-qcs6490, qcom-qcs8300, qcom-qcs9100,
 qcom-sc8280xp, qcom-sm8550, qcom-sm8650, qcom-x1e80100,
 qcom_q6v5_mss, qcom_q6v5_pas, qdu100, and sdx61.
